{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》爆發激烈肢體衝突，陳星妤（Yvette）今日在社交平台發文，為節目中過度用力弄傷陳若思（Amber）一事公開致歉。「睇返今次節目，我有認真反省。當時太投入比賽了，冇控制分寸同力度，心裏真係唔好受。 Amber，抱歉令你受傷了。見到你嘅瘀傷，我好自責，希望你快啲好返。」</p><figure><img alt=\"陳星妤玩滑梯。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193730377043283968803714.jpeg/Fy0d9HfnIbYH5TK2yFkI3GZ8jVIKVMV4NL6_NzS-vzc\"/><figcaption>陳星妤玩滑梯。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳星妤好sexy。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193730374635622400873594.jpeg/NnYYNPM_-tXvxlA6q-iylqyKrYUWzcrdoLZFBKC2RQQ\"/><figcaption>陳星妤好sexy。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳星妤發文道歉。（threads@yvette.cc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193914587779436544517236.png/K_dZMQ-d5GGJOxlieKT8tMNGa-nXbAvsjiEWeY4hFnk\"/><figcaption>陳星妤發文道歉。（threads@yvette.cc）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"賽後亦有安慰。（threads@yvette.cc）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193914922493284352839427.png/OVQmIb4ioRhxjoUb4nqK8RgbO-LuoyHBPtRsfz7UbH8\"/><figcaption>賽後亦有安慰。（threads@yvette.cc）</figcaption></figure><p>施展龍爪手強行箍頸　撳人落水惹公憤</p><p>昨晚（1日）播出的第9集節目中，一眾女神移師主題公園進行「水上騎膊馬」混戰。首輪由身形嬌小的陳星妤對戰陳若思，戰況極度激烈。初段陳若思「戰狼」上身採取主動攻擊，陳星妤先將腰向後拗企圖避開；隨着對手氣力不繼，陳星妤隨即發惡反擊。陳星妤先是一手扯住陳若思的衣服並推其面部，其後更出盡全力施展「龍爪手」掐捏對方的頸部，企圖將對方拉跌。最令網民嘩然的是，即使陳若思最終已被推落水，陳星妤依然出力將她的頭撳入水中，手段極其「狼死」。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳星妤主動猛攻。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193730691742175232973051.jpeg/LHKOEjk4lAAs7nHj4LhBVyb5Qb0CZ6bwenB7tnpwe7Y\"/><figcaption>陳星妤主動猛攻。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳星妤攻擊陳若思的頸部。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193730689493897216982056.jpeg/gCdNsaTZW2uG19_Arm_8abx5UwAgA06j-84Tz_vOE88\"/><figcaption>陳星妤攻擊陳若思的頸部。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳星妤攻擊陳若思的頸部。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193730687270785024859346.jpeg/ZY2o46C2ep8KSa0rKdHJGBYTKfSH_iKQW61gQVutYEE\"/><figcaption>陳星妤攻擊陳若思的頸部。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民直斥陳星妤為「恐怖女神」。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193731692133617664721398.jpeg/MOvlxcohTRDxYPdSjxw0K07eqYOzp-fgAFQ4rQBUOK0\"/><figcaption>網民直斥陳星妤為「恐怖女神」。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"出動「龍爪手」！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909481583415296246739.png/17jw0PmAVWWa4aiTZCUpaaSypnn9MgzaGdGlxBnRpcQ\"/><figcaption>出動「龍爪手」！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909645857525760157802.png/u1ZmnRoNUhKtC--zLZ_K4t6CNZ3T4Unxtb47sLW-O7A\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909648294547456231748.png/GhTkMiRAFMDaD-3sCqKR8BvlrZvTZsxAJiCKyCYgisg\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909650744152064723584.png/h0v2EdD9EP-rSM8l7mUeogQsthFUlu-fIh4IRyIeCEc\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909652866600960053976.png/FLrMsKtEjLWjn9msgovnp3_FD-xgWj14jndeKo53Xio\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909655161016320165908.png/zk-ZfHz8lZUVsWZP4yy5jPjXr6KS6NX0oKl_XaCpf10\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909646457311232249058.png/Z0LNVGMxZ2M_Mo7qOiCwtZet99dwGiEAEqi2dxKotnc\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909648860778496053419.png/Byk-ZOgfxAxwhKjZMEXJAPauPPTBKVi_oeorraHqK60\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909651176165376123549.png/fD3VcB1kvuoFjYMN79XrI2Ch83KeAXvBQkgse0JILHs\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909653567049728501423.png/TXi3ToZKriBUrf3Mth2Tv-XkyMbMPganr_Nl-q_zZfo\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909655588835328695124.png/0CG-4EXaRDbEBY2DBVZmF3icXjn3JQewK8j52ivI-do\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909646272761856917360.png/tNcWzTW69toLOhoW0DIFHPVPD7GZ6WnRBGovFARqLxQ\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909648613314560537082.png/srydJnhfNzAQEY5gZXdcmZ1yY_D-bxiPkSFKPZEhSj0\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909650773512192198736.png/5rT477n-jcchuM75qACFNx1xL-tozAmXgDzRuoA80bo\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909653139230720804195.png/BuSuJxTa6LgMWxZKAxOxjpyMm0yvpKaafTY9AH02PQA\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909655278456832476521.png/tVfYFdD6rxPInqUv28m4XlXm4ptzo6dRcK8xjHCvMYw\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909637292756992461307.png/NDnLssKVXJ2D0uiqvlAKXJ1W1_y15NLqhIUqeISFKng\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909639763333120781642.png/naZhsndarSP7KaYK-ny2jDYaI5Hvo41mvtlobb7ZaG0\"/><figcaption>爭仔大戰逐格睇！(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>陳若思心有餘悸　男伴林子朗憂心安全</p><p>慘遭強攻的陳若思事後猶有餘悸，直言對手極度硬淨：「我全程只係諗住拉佢落嚟、將佢推落水，但佢實在太頑強喇！我點拉點推，佢都好似穩如泰山咁，完全拉唔到佢落水！」與陳若思同組出戰的男伴林子朗亦表示擔憂：「因為當時喺水裡面睇唔到上面，只顧住唔可以放手，其實我好care Amber嘅安全問題，就算贏咗比賽，但如果整傷Amber，我會覺得好內疚。」</p><figure><img alt=\"林子朗都擔心安全，覺得贏比賽都冇用。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193909725754822656702495.png/vuEmj5866SSNpeyYyhsNjqma3Z8TsPcvs3HksLNx5LA\"/><figcaption>林子朗都擔心安全，覺得贏比賽都冇用。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>網民截圖見頸部損晒　炮轟道歉貓哭老鼠</p><p>陳若思上岸後被發現整條頸紅腫兼佈滿瘀傷，更有網民截圖見其頸部疑似流血損晒，直指戥她肉赤。大批網民隨即在社交平台洗版式狂轟陳星妤出手極度兇狠，不顧對手安全，直斥她是「恐怖女神」。</p><p>對於陳星妤遲來的致歉，網民完全不賣帳，紛紛留言炮轟：「報警傷人！有晒片有晒證據……撳人個頭落水！」、「Amber已經落水，再襟入水就唔止是遊戲想贏啦。」 有網民更質疑其道歉誠意：「吓？你係咪嚟搞笑？而家道歉有咩用，今集之前已經錄完而家先say sorry，同埋如果你係真係驚整傷人第二round就唔會繼續係咁啦！」，怒斥她「贏比賽輸人品」及「貓哭老鼠」。目前陳若思仍未就道歉一事作任何表態。</p><figure><img alt=\"網民截圖，見陳若思條頸損晒，出現血痕！(小紅書)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193910211631386624752310.png/UXJLDo9mRUAvrdSfflKD-jOxxZXHZHhSdK768nSu-vI\"/><figcaption>網民截圖，見陳若思條頸損晒，出現血痕！(小紅書)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"又紅又損。(TVB截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193915128500719616406572.png/5ylKDSfWGntDYfXDgH3dYpO-zowxgK1EMvpP-zL6T_s\"/><figcaption>又紅又損。(TVB截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好多人關心陳若思。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193916085879967744067135.png/zSqCmtPw0-5v86Ci5wPZhmQemCsKsiiAicWlZYnFpWU\"/><figcaption>好多人關心陳若思。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民一面倒狂鬧陳星妤玩得太過火。（threads截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193916216251518976521847.png/iEPyZlY2dkxbA1NJv4fU281XNu9HX2KlKdFQ6ynRUOs\"/><figcaption>網民一面倒狂鬧陳星妤玩得太過火。（threads截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民一面倒狂鬧陳星妤玩得太過火。（threads截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193916218625626112617082.png/rM8y-l4c0yGWwvMeXC97_awYn5ixjIQTVPhORlT4TkY\"/><figcaption>網民一面倒狂鬧陳星妤玩得太過火。（threads截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民一面倒狂鬧陳星妤玩得太過火。（threads截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193916220823572480952837.png/utR2Yn6y2qk_5qWRHawPw4El7jqKIkM3TYTs202E7Ns\"/><figcaption>網民一面倒狂鬧陳星妤玩得太過火。（threads截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民一面倒狂鬧陳星妤玩得太過火。（threads截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193916223143153664165923.png/5ReMzxOGmX3_hXUCE_ctAhdU3S74dNPXpjbYAKY22AA\"/><figcaption>網民一面倒狂鬧陳星妤玩得太過火。（threads截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳星妤扯衫推頸撳陳若思落水。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193730685085421568753941.jpeg/KR2fczhrxAGFDmF8MKiZA7jurTRPA-fgbt37O27d-zs\"/><figcaption>陳星妤扯衫推頸撳陳若思落水。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳星妤玩水戰勁兇狠。(節目截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193731701416136704143807.jpeg/EEn0SKHLeq_cs7vDXwCPp55cFanwAzOVb_cj12_3I9c\"/><figcaption>陳星妤玩水戰勁兇狠。(節目截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民怒轟陳星妤。(threads截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193731699213996032391058.png/bfNaM1OJvA1sKnRH8Ppue8g9KMy2nJTauOMlSLjjJUg\"/><figcaption>網民怒轟陳星妤。(threads截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民覺得陳星妤太粗暴。(threads截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193731696911192064940538.png/bTeO2fxSrk8AWmS1FbhZes-SkMCqJ0wfDbavZQ22r2U\"/><figcaption>網民覺得陳星妤太粗暴。(threads截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳星妤推陳若思落水勁兇狠。(threads截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193731694788743168271638.png/q6z0b6tw2wFINRi6NxsulMeSHdcjgNy-EQ_UsBEP1LA\"/><figcaption>陳星妤推陳若思落水勁兇狠。(threads截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳星妤推陳若思落水勁兇狠。(threads截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1193731692607574016756293.png/SFCF7l2E8FeF0LuDMov4k9xAZ6aB6DsS2Wkn_NlpJ_w\"/><figcaption>陳星妤推陳若思落水勁兇狠。(threads截圖)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:40:46.411614+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1624,"images":40,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:11:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T05:59:05.906112+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:38:16.999415+00:00","content_hash":"52e352ade6e05a7578aefcede64c1ffad70992aba3fb7c2dc7fe3b8d500ccaf1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}